        Not-a-Bandit: Provably No-Regret Drafter Selection in <span class="search-hit mathjax">Speculative</span> <span class="search-hit mathjax">Decoding</span> for LLMs
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Liu%2C+H">Hongyi Liu</a>, 
      
