        Energy-Latency Optimization for Dynamic <span class="search-hit mathjax">Disaggregated</span> Radio Access Networks
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=H.%2C+G+N+C">Gabriela N. Caspa H.</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Astudillo%2C+C+A">Carlos A. Astudillo</a>, 
      
